===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|frm|misaine}}, modified from {{der|en|fro|migenne}} (through influence from Italian {{m|it|mezzana}}), from {{der|en|roa-oca|mitjana}}, feminine of {{m|ca|mitjan}}, ultimately from {{der|en|la|medianus}}. {{doublet|en|mean|median}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈmɪ.zən/}}
